## Production Environment Variables

# Backend API Base URL (used in production, dev uses proxy)
VITE_API_BASE_URL=http://72.60.102.36:5003/api

# For subpath deployment (uncomment and set if deployed to /app/ or similar)
# VITE_BASE_URL=/app/

# Uncomment for custom socket URL if needed
# VITE_SOCKET_URL=ws://72.60.102.36:5003

## Deployment Notes:
# 1. Copy this to .env and adjust VITE_API_BASE_URL to your backend
# 2. For subpath: set base in vite.config.js to match VITE_BASE_URL
# 3. Build: npm run build
# 4. Serve dist/ with SPA rewrite (see README.md)
